register_gate "tests/test_render_warn_emphasis.py" "RENDER WARN EMPHASIS GATE: PASS" "render warn emphasis (defense-in-depth on the no-textual-conflict framing under adversarial engine payloads)" "render warn emphasis: the PO 2026-06-25 finding 4 dogfood follow-up locks the no-merge-conflict-on-warn contract from the OTHER side -- under ADVERSARIAL engine payloads. The first-round precision PR (#457) softened the SERIALIZE / SERIALIZE_SOFT merge-conflict headlines and led the WARN bold tag with 'semantic coupling, not a git conflict'. THIS gate pins that contract against engine bugs the renderer might see in the wild: (1) a WARN with a stray merge_conflict_likely=True flag MUST NOT emit a merge-conflict heads-up; (2) same for a WARN with a stray conflict_points list; (3) same for UNKNOWN and CLEAR (neither has analyzable line-range geometry); (4) the WARN bold lead carries the no-textual-conflict framing FIRST on BOTH the contested_with arm AND the corroborated-hub arm; (5) honest-copy invariants (no 'will definitely' / 'guaranteed' / 'you will conflict') hold on every adversarial case; (6) the SERIALIZE_SOFT happy path STILL emits the softened heads-up (defense-in-depth did not regress the legitimate use case). The render-side scrub clamps merge_conflict_likely=False and conflict_points=[] before reaching _render_collision_prose when verdict is not in (serialize, serialize_soft) -- byte-identical to today for every honest input. PURE + offline (render_pr_check is stateless), content-free throughout (paths + line numbers only)" "render warn emphasis: defense-in-depth on the no-textual-conflict framing. A WARN / UNKNOWN / CLEAR with a stray merge_conflict_likely or conflict_points from a future engine bug must NOT emit a merge-conflict heads-up (the render scrubs the input at the call site before it reaches _render_collision_prose). The WARN bold lead carries 'semantic coupling, not a git conflict' FIRST on both the contested_with arm and the corroborated-hub arm. The SERIALIZE_SOFT happy path is unaffected (the softened heads-up still emits). Wording + scrub only, verdict-logic + engine unchanged, content-free" 16
